OL,3,GNEWSAFlights diverted after Manchester
OL,4,AAirport security breach
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven flights had to be diverted and 17
OL,7,Fheld in the skies above Manchester
OL,8,FAirport after a man trespassed on the
OL,9,Fairfield.
OL,11,FIt happened at about 23:21 BST on
OL,12,FFriday and the airfield had to be
OL,13,Fclosed for 15 minutes, while police
OL,14,Fattended and arrested the man.
OL,16,FGreater Manchester Police said: "We
OL,17,Fresponded to reports of male who had
OL,18,Fbeen located air-side at Manchester
OL,19,FAirport.
